<title>USA: Morgan Stanley Group may issue $750 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley Group may issue $750 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Group Inc is expected to issue $750 million in 10-year notes on Friday, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc is expected to be the lead manager for the deal.</p>
<p>The non-callable A1/A+ notes have price talk in the range of 57 to 59 basis points over the U.S. Treasury note.</p>
<p>((-- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
